OL,3,A'Backpack' declared Alaska's Fat Bear
OL,4,AWeek winner
OL,5,
OL,6,FA brown bear known as 89 Backpack has
OL,7,Fwon the annual Fat Bear Week
OL,8,Fcompetition, after what the US National
OL,9,FParks Service described as a "battle of
OL,10,Fsize, skill, snack acquisition, and
OL,11,Fstrategic loafing".
OL,13,FBackpack's wideness narrowly defeated a
OL,14,Fbear known only as 910, earning 103,344
OL,15,Fvotes to 910's 98,253 in the final
OL,16,Fround of the competition, which is run
OL,17,Fby the Katmai National Park in Alaska.
OL,19,FThe National Parks Service thanked the
OL,20,F16 bears who "involuntarily
OL,21,Fparticipated" in the competition, now
OL,22,Fin its thirteenth year.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
