OL,3,A'Backpack' declared Alaska's Fat Bear
OL,4,AWeek winner
OL,5,
OL,6,FBackpack, who was described by one
OL,7,Fsupporter as having both the "chonk and
OL,8,Fthe badonk", will shortly enter
OL,9,Fhibernation, which can last up to six
OL,10,Fmonths.
